### Simulation Results (14-Day Period)

**Total Policy Matches**: 4,287
**Unique Users Affected**: 892
**Unique Files/Messages**: 3,641

| Rule | Matches | Action | Override Rate |
|------|---------|--------|---------------|
| Block Bulk Credit Card Sharing (5+) | 47 | Block | N/A |
