- SPF record passes validation at mxtoolbox.com
- DKIM signature verified on test emails
- DMARC record properly formatted and reporting enabled
- Test emails pass all three checks in recipient's Authentication-Results header$S$, '{"python_exec","shell_exec","create_deliverable"}', $S${"source":"mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills","pack":"cybersecurity","domain":"cybersecurity","subdomain":"phishing-defense","tags":["Code","Testing","Analysis","Automation","Security","Compliance"],"files":3}$S$::jsonb, true)
