- SPF RFC 7208: https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7208
- DMARC RFC 7489: https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7489
- DKIM RFC 6376: https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6376
- dnspython: https://dnspython.readthedocs.io/
