- **Proofpoint TAP Dashboard**: https://threatinsight.proofpoint.com/
- **Proofpoint API**: https://help.proofpoint.com/Threat_Insight_Dashboard/API_Documentation
- **Proofpoint Community**: https://community.proofpoint.com/

