- Attachment detonation catches EICAR test file and macro-enabled document
- URL Defense rewrites and blocks known phishing URLs
- TAP Dashboard displays threat summary
- SIEM receives and alerts on TAP events$S$, '{"browse_web","http_get","create_deliverable"}', $S${"source":"mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills","pack":"cybersecurity","domain":"cybersecurity","subdomain":"phishing-defense","tags":["Code","Testing","Analysis","Automation","Security","Compliance"],"files":3}$S$::jsonb, true)
