| `crime_prevention` | DPA 2018 Sch. 2 Para 2 | withhold |
| `management_forecasting` | DPA 2018 Sch. 2 Para 22 | withhold |
| `negotiations` | DPA 2018 Sch. 2 Para 24 | withhold |
