- Configuration validation report
- Log routing topology diagram (text-based)
- Test event delivery confirmation$S$, '{"http_get","python_exec","shell_exec","create_deliverable"}', $S${"source":"mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills","pack":"cybersecurity","domain":"cybersecurity","subdomain":"security-operations","tags":["Code","Testing","Analysis","Security","Compliance"],"files":1}$S$::jsonb, true)
