## Microsoft Intune MAM API (Graph)

```python
import requests
headers = {"Authorization": "Bearer <token>"}
# List MAM policies
policies = requests.get(
    "https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/deviceAppManagement/managedAppPolicies",
